ions/71"} "Venues"] ")\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Competition dates"] "\n" [:td {} "\n29 October – 13 November\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "\nOverview\n\n"] "\n" [:div {:class "description"} "\n" [:p {} "The 4th Youth Olympic Games (YOG) was scheduled to be held in 2022. Dakar, Senegal was selected by unanimous approval on 8 October 2018 at the 133rd IOC Session in Buenos Aires, Argentina. The 2022 YOG was planned for 22 October to 9 November 2022. However, after the postponement of the 2020 Tokyo Olympics, due to the COVID-19 pandemic, the IOC and the Senegalese Organizing Committee postponed the 4th Youth Olympic Games to 2026."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Bid process"] "\n" [:div {:class "description"} "\n" [:p {} "Bid voting at the 133th " [:a {:href "/meetings"} "IOC Session"] " in Buenos Aires, Argentina on 8 October 2018. Dakar, Senegal was selected as the host city by acclamation. No other cities made formal bids, nor made it to the voting session, although several other cities had expressed an interest in hosting."] "\n\n"] "\n\n\n"] "\n" [:footer {:class "footer"} "\n" [:br {}] "\n" [:div {:class "panel panel-info"} "\n" [:div {:class "panel-heading"} "\n" [:h3 {:class "panel-title"} "\n" [:span {:class "glyphicon glyphicon-info-sign"}] "\nDid you know?\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:div {:class "panel-body"} "\n" [:p {} "Speed skating was conducted outdoors at the Winter Olympics until the advent of indoor ovals in the 1980s. Since 1994, an indoor oval is a requirement, and the last time speed skating was held outdoors was in Albertville, 1992."] "\n\n\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:div {:class "container"} "\n" [:p {} "\n" [:a {:href "/users/sign_in"} "Login"] "\n|\n" [:a {:href "/statistics/site"} "Statistics"] "\n|\n" [:a {:href "/static/about"} "About"] "\n|\n" [:a {:href "/static/faq"} "FAQ"] "\n|\n" [:a {:href "/feedbacks/new"} "Feedback"] "\n"] "\n" [:p {} "\n© " [:a {:href "/static/about"} "OlyMADMen"] " 2006 — 2026\n"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n\n" [:script {:src "/assets/l